            "detailed_description": "<h1>Wishlist our new game!</h1><p></p><br><h1>Acerca do jogo</h1>Hack_me is a hacker simulator game. The main objective in game – is to hack big companies's servers to show people that there is nothing in this world that protected on 100%. You’ll need to use your cmd, bruteforce, SQL-injectors and other programs to hack servers. <br><br>FEATURES <br>• References to Mr. Robot and other films and games <br>• Dozens of hacker’s stuffs to achieve your goals <br>• Dynamic gameplay <br>• Real hacking - you'll use real ways and programms to achieve your goals (all programms were renaimed for for general security ;D )<br>• Pleasant atmosphere – music, graphics, and your partner – Elena, prepare you to have a good time",
